  "explanatory_notes": "<table><tr> <td colspan=\"3\" style=\"width:454.9pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"607\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph; line-height:14.0pt\">Explanatory Notes:</p> </td> </tr>\n<tr> <td style=\"width:34.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"46\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.0pt\">1.</p> </td> <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:420.7pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"561\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph; line-height:14.0pt\">Entry requirement:</p> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph; line-height:14.0pt\">Students are required to take PSYC1000 before being\n\n admitted to the Minor Programme.</p> </td> </tr>\n<tr> <td style=\"width:34.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"46\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.0pt\">[a]</p> </td> <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:420.7pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"561\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph; line-height:14.0pt\">Students are advised to take PSYC1000. Students who\n\n have taken UGED2581 should take another PSYC course as a substitute of\n\n PSYC1000 to fulfil the Minor requirements.</p> </td> </tr>\n<tr> <td style=\"width:34.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"46\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.0pt\">[b]</p> </td> <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:420.7pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"561\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph; line-height:14.0pt\">Students are advised to take PSYC2010. Students who\n\n have taken any of the equivalent statistics courses including COMM3110,\n\n DOTE2011, ECON2121, GRMD2102, LING3403, PHPC2015, SEEM2430, SOCI2004,\n\n SPED2600, STAT2001 and 2006, STAT2101 and 2102 are exempted from taking\n\n PSYC2010, and they are required to take another PSYC course listed under\n\n 2. Elective Courses to compensate for the units.</p> </td> </tr>\n<tr> <td style=\"width:34.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"46\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.0pt\"> </p> </td> <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:420.7pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"561\"> <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph; line-height:14.0pt\"> </p> </td> </tr></table>",
